The PIR323 Multi-sensor is used to measure the ambient temperature & humidity with built-in sensor and external temperature with remote probe. It is available to detect motion, vibration and receive notifications from the mobile app.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0
- PIR motion detection
- Vibration detection
- Environmental temperature & humidity measuring
- Remote probe (external temperature)
- Low power consumption
